# --- Door.events (locked-door puzzle) ---
# `my Locked` = door state (true while locked). `HasKey` = global flag set on key pickup.
# Hover hint is gated on `my Locked` so it stops overwriting the unlock message once opened.

when me appears
  set my Locked to true

when me is hovered
  my Locked is true
  show text "A locked door."

when me is clicked
  my Locked is true
  unless HasKey is true
  play sound "locked.wav"
  show text "It's locked."

when me is clicked
  my Locked is true
  HasKey is true
  play sound "unlock.wav"
  set my Locked to false
  show text "The door creaks open."
